      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我也能够理解她为什么害怕踏入出道后的世界。\n但是，这位名为菱钻奇宝的赛马娘──",
      "source_fingerprint": "092c94c6f759f4fd5a900bf70ddc7bf9b29a792a3353adb35cd929a0129ab93a",
